# Sitting 9: gp=1 rnbc=0 ddset=0 on the ASUS. The MAC counted the frame and
# no descriptor came back. Until 2026-08-21 codex-vm counted GPRC after the
# writeback, so every fault here read gprc=0 and answered the row above it.
#
# -nic-bme-clear is the cause this arm can use: DMA is gated from before
# bring-up, where the K1 stall cannot be, because the canned injector empties
# its budget at RCTL.EN and e1000-init has done the K1 step by then.
-e1000-inject 1 -nic-bme-clear
